<h1>Meeting 42</h1>
<p>Held 23 September 2026.</p>
<ol>
<li>Edition 2 of HL-103 was approved, in force from 1 October 2026.</li>
<li>A public consultation on HL-105 will open in November 2026.</li>
</ol>
